DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerHidden Gem Creative Studios / 
 Coro Nueva EraCelebrate the premiere of La Caravana\, a music video featur
 ing 25 immigrant domestic workers and day laborers telling a story of migr
 ation\, solidarity\, and hope.\nThe evening features live performances by 
 Coro Nueva Era\, Del Barrio Teatro\, and Teatro Nuevo Sol\, followed by th
 e video premiere\, an artist Q&A\, and a DJ dance celebration. Proceeds su
 pport the Center for Social and Economic Justice.\n\nPresented by Healthy 
 Bodies\, Healthy Minds in collaboration with Nuevo Sol Day Labor and Domes
 tic Worker Center\, and co-presented by Dance Mission Theater.\n\n$15.00\n
 \nTickets: https://dancemissiontheater.org/2026/09/29/nov-21-la-caravana/\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/la-caravana-music-video-premiere-communi
 ty-celebration/\nSource: Funcheap SF
