SUMMARY:The Grand Budapest Hotel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261125T213000
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-18017402@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:A murder case of Madam D. with enormous wealth and the most ou
 trageous events surrounding her sudden death!\n\nThe Grand Budapest Hotel 
 tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars
  and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protég
 é. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance p
 ainting\, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then 
 sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th
  century.\n\nFor our Annual Pass Members and Loyalty Card Holders:\n\nTick
 ets for this film can be acquired in-person at the Box Office with loyalty
  cards or our Annual CinemaSF passes on the day of the show while supplies
  last.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/25/the-grand-budape
 st-hotel-tickets-kl533x1\nSource: DoTheBay
