 rave.\n\nHappy (7 Minutes)\n\nDuring a boring visit to her grandmother's h
 ouse\, Cárol discovers a unique doll to kill time with. But she soon real
 izes that\, in that house\, she isn't the only one who knows how to have f
 un.\n\nHouse Cat (15 Minutes)\n\nLiving out of her car and hustling gig to
