 scover she isn’t there to care for the cat\; she is the cat.\n\nHousewif
 e (5 Minutes)\n\nWhen a woman accidentally cuts herself on her forgotten d
 ollhouse\, she’ll unwittingly awaken Housewife\, a primordial monster wi
 th strange ideas about how to care for her children. Based on the characte
