DESCRIPTION:THE SAW IS BACK!\n\nForty years after its original release\, T
 obe Hooper's gloriously deranged sequel returns to the big screen in all i
 ts outrageous\, blood-soaked glory!\n\nThirteen years after the events of 
 the original Texas Chain Saw Massacre\, Leatherface and his cannibalistic 
 family are back\, terrorizing Texas with chainsaws\, twisted humor\, and s
 pectacularly gruesome practical effects by legendary makeup artist Tom Sav
 ini. Dennis Hopper delivers an unforgettable\, completely unhinged perform
 ance as a vengeance-obsessed former Texas Ranger determined to bring the S
 awyer family down.\n\nLouder\, bloodier\, funnier\, and more outrageous th
 an its predecessor\, The Texas Chainsaw Massacre 2 is an unapologetic 1980
 s horror cult classic that demands to be experienced with a theater full o
 f fellow horror fans.\n\nTHIS IS NOT A DIGITAL SCREENING!\n\nAnother Hole 
 in the Head Film Festival is proud to present an exceptionally clean\, ori
 ginal 1986 UNRATED and UNCUT 35mm release print\, featuring beautiful AGFA
  low-fade color and the original Dolby Stereo optical soundtrack.\n\nNo st
 reaming. No DCP. Just genuine vintage 35mm film projected on the big scree
 n\, exactly the way audiences experienced it in 1986.\n\nPlaying as part o
 f Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/c
 alendar-of-events/ahith-2026-texas-chainsaw-massacre-2\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/12/5/ahith-fest-2026-the-texas-chainsaw-massacre-t
 ickets\nSource: DoTheBay
