DESCRIPTION:A curated collection of genre films highlighting the LGBTQ+ co
 mmunity.\n\nTitles are listed alphabetically\, not in their screening orde
 r.\n\nBad Dad (12 Minutes)\n\nWith his divorce barely finalized\, Warren r
 etreats from the city he always resented to a quiet lake house\, hoping to
  find some peace with his young son\, KJ. But when a stranger named David 
 turns up at the door asking for help\, the night takes a turn Warren never
  could have anticipated.\n\nGET INTO THE SPIRIT (5 Minutes)\n\nWhile attem
 pting to communicate with a handsome ghost haunting their house\, two husb
 ands discover there are many ways a spirit can reach out from beyond the g
 rave.\n\ni love zombies (7 Minutes)\n\nA Latina influencer survives the zo
 mbie apocalypse by hosting a rogue walkie-talkie podcast to find supplies 
 and other sapphics. When her ex shows up with a new girlfriend and learns 
 zombies are bilingual\, survival gets complicated.\n\nThe Inheritance (15 
 Minutes)\n\nVenus\, a Black violinist\, accompanies her wife\, Harley\, to
  clear out a family estate. Once there\, Venus begins experiencing disturb
 ing visions that blur the line between past and present\, drawing her into
  the house’s dark history. As the haunting intensifies\, she uncovers bu
 ried secrets of generational trauma\, ancestral legacies\, and unspoken fa
 mily pain.\n\nJack $hack (15 Minutes)\n\nJack $hack is a comedic and fanta
 stical exploration of hustle culture.\n\nDesperate to raise funds for thei
 r church\, a trio of color-run participants attempt a short cut to win pri
 z...\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-202
 6-shorts-collection-5\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/ahit
 h-fest-2026-short-film-collection-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
