CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:After the death of her mother\, Evelyn\, an aimless Norwegian-
 American woman\, is stranded and alone in a small Norwegian town. After ye
 ars as her mother’s sole caretaker during a lengthy illness\, she has fa
 llen out of touch with her old life. Her overbearing Aunt Marit forces her
  way into Evelyn’s life and insists she get out of the house and get a j
 ob. As she sinks deeper into depression\, Evelyn becomes obsessed with a c
 ozy American sitcom called “Life at Sandy’s.” She starts to recede f
 rom real life as she becomes friends with the show’s characters\, and sh
 e is soon invited to spend time in their world. The worse things get for E
 velyn in the real world\, the longer her stays in the sitcom become. Sandy
 \, the coffee shop owner\, offers her a chance to stay with them forever\,
  for a price.\n\n+ 4 Short Films\n\nMedieval Wound Man (4 Minutes)\n\nFres
 hly-spawned\, an artificial human flees an anatomical theater—with medic
 al students in hot pursuit.\n\nThat Damn Cat (14 Minutes)\n\nA cat becomes
  envious of his owner’s romantic interests.\n\nThe Chosen (9 Minutes)\n\
 nReed is troubled by a vision forcing him to do bad things\, but nobody be
 lieves him. Maybe this new therapist will understand?\n\nViolet Light - Da
 hlia's New Friend (3 Minutes)\n\nThe familiar shifts out of sight when you
 're in Violet Light.\n\nDahlia reaches beyond the visible world in search 
 of a gift for herself\, drawing on forces she does not fully understand. I
 n doing so\, she opens a quiet passage—one that allows something else to
  enter.\n\nP...\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-event
 s/ahith-2026-life-at-sandys\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/
 6/ahith-fest-2026-life-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7760419;-122.498063
