BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AHITH FEST 2026: Starslyderz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T220000
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-18071092@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:20 years later\, STARSLYDERZ comes home!\n\nIn 2006\, a bonker
 s\, no-budget sci-fi comedy called STARSLYDERZ premiered at Another Hole i
 n the Head Film Festival\, where Variety boldly declared\, “Cult status 
 is assured.”\n\nThe film went on to screen at Fantasia and open France's
  Mauvais Genre Festival before being picked up by a distributor who prompt
 ly buried it. When the heartbroken filmmakers finally regained the rights 
 five years later\, they made an unusual decision: lock it away and let it 
 age like a fine wine.\n\nNow\, 20 years after its original AHITH premiere\
 , STARSLYDERZ returns to the festival where it all began\, featuring a new
 ly remastered edit that no audience has ever seen!\n\nShot guerrilla-style
  over two chaotic weeks on MiniDV throughout San Francisco\, this glorious
 ly unhinged sci-fi adventure features a troupe of sleep-deprived young act
 ors\, an army of puppets\, the work of approximately 150 volunteer visual 
 effects artists\, and an incredible soundtrack featuring Santa Cruz's lege
 ndary experimental band Estradasphere.\n\nYou've never seen anything quite
  like STARSLYDERZ.\n\nJoin us for this special 20th Anniversary Re-Premier
 e\, with the filmmakers in attendance and a theater full of fellow weirdos
 !\n\nOne film. Twenty years. A whole new level of strange.\n\nPlaying as p
 art of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.
 com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-starslyderz\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/12/7/ahith-fest-2026-starslyderz-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
