SUMMARY:AHITH FEST 2026: The Shining Forwards and Backwards + 2 Short Film
 s
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261208T210000
DTSTAMP:20261126T170128Z
UID:dothebay-18071091@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:You've seen The Shining. You've never seen it like this.\n\nWh
 at happens when Stanley Kubrick's legendary horror masterpiece plays forwa
 rds and backwards simultaneously\, with both versions superimposed over on
 e another?\n\nThe result is a mesmerizing and sometimes deeply unsettling 
 collision of images\, strange coincidences\, and astonishing visual symmet
 ries.\n\nFaces merge. Hallways intersect. Characters appear to encounter t
 heir own past and future. The Overlook Hotel becomes an entirely new labyr
 inth of visual mysteries.\n\nAre these bizarre connections simply coincide
 nce? Or is there something deeper buried within Kubrick's meticulously con
 structed masterpiece?\n\nThere's only one way to find out.\n\n+ 2 Short Fi
 lms\n\nPokey (18 Minutes)\n\nWhen a clueless teenager posing as a hitman t
 akes money from a child who wants someone dead\, what seems like an easy s
 cam pulls him into something far more dangerous than he bargained for.\n\n
 They Lurk Beneath Eyelids (4 Minutes)\n\nA couple faces various horrific a
 nd psychological ordeals while being trapped in a labyrinth of nightmares.
 \n\nPlaying as part of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https://w
 ww.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-The%20Shining%20Forwards
 %20and%20Backwards\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/8/ahith-f
 est-2026-the-shining-forwards-and-backwards-2-short-films-tickets\nSource:
  DoTheBay
