CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Years after the collapse of civilization\, the tyrannical Immo
 rtan Joe enslaves apocalypse survivors inside the desert fortress the Cita
 del. When the warrior Imperator Furiosa leads the despot’s five wives in
  a daring escape\, she forges an alliance with Max Rockatansky\, a loner a
 nd former captive. Fortified in the massive\, armored truck the War Rig\, 
 they try to outrun the ruthless warlord and his henchmen in a deadly high-
 speed chase through the Wasteland. Presented in Black and Chrome\, the mon
 ochrome regrade preferred by director George Miller.\n\n+ 2 Short Films\n\
 nShared Experience (12 Minutes)\n\nDespite a reluctance towards online dat
 ing\, Anna goes out with Luke\, a man she meets on Hinge. To her surprise\
 , they form a connection. However\, she quickly learns that her definition
  of connection is slightly different than Luke's.\n\nI Don't Know Her (7 M
 inutes)\n\nA séance opens a door to the unfamiliar.\n\nPlaying as part of
  Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/ca
 lendar-of-events/ahith-2026-mad-max-fury-road\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/12/9/ahith-fest-2026-mad-max-fury-road-2-short-films-ticket
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
