 ural brothel are patronized by a trio of obnoxious expats. After an accide
 ntal death\, the young women\, lead by their mother-figure madame\, must d
 ecide how to protect their home and livelihoods from this invasive species
 .\n\n+ 2 Short Films\n\nTender Objects (12 Minutes)\n\nOn Halloween night\
 , a meticulous suburban serial killer invites a woman home for a first dat
 e. But when she uncovers his disturbing collection\, his carefully control
 led evening spirals into a dangerous game of desire and deception.\n\nIt's
  Not the Water (7 Minutes)\n\nA weary passenger aboard a nearly empty 1880
 s steamship becomes convinced that something in the water is driving men o
 verboard.\n\nPlaying as part of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: 
 https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-unsavory-elemen
