 e with the dead. What follows is a battle of wills\, cycling through stage
 s of tenderness and bitter exploitation\, as each woman struggles for domi
 nance in their increasingly toxic and unsustainable relationship. Through 
 all of this\, the ghost of Meg’s husband watches silently\, with plans o
 f his own\n\n+ 1 Short Film\n\nAntediluvian Falls: Internal Stalker (2 Min
 utes)\n\nA cheerful tourism reel for Antediluvian Falls becomes an emergen
 cy warning about a grinning figure who infiltrates images\, memories\, and
  the minds of those who see him. As the stalker isolates his victims from 
 the people they love\, the town offers one horrifying method of interventi
 on.\n\nPlaying as part of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https:
