DESCRIPTION:A diverse collection of non-Feature films from varied genres.\
 n\nTitles are listed alphabetically\, not in their screening order.\n\n3:0
 3 AM (4 Minutes)\n\nAt 3:03 AM\, Michelle hears sounds coming from inside 
 her bedroom.\n\nFamily Dinner (6 Minutes)\n\nIn a near-future food-starved
  America\, Mia (Tyner Rushing - It: Welcome to Derry\, For All Mankind\, S
 tranger Things)\, returns home for a sumptuous family dinner in the wake o
 f her grandma's death.\n\nJingle Jangle (11 Minutes)\n\nTwo regular dudes 
 sneak into their friend's apartment to implement the next phase in a prank
  war... and instead witness a murder.\n\nJust Relax (8 Minutes)\n\nA troub
 led young woman undergoes a supernatural meditation for memory loss and di
 scovers something more twisted than she ever could have imagined.\n\nMetho
 d (15 Minutes)\n\nA struggling horror author reluctantly turns to an AI as
 sistant for inspiration\, only to find her pursuit of authenticity spirali
 ng into a dangerous obsession.\n\nNothin' Beats a Cheeseburger (4 Minutes)
 \n\nAn interplanetary explorer named Borg travels across the galaxy for th
 e world's best cheeseburger.\n\nSync (16 Minutes)\n\nA promising teenage s
 inger faces disappointment from his father when his voice breaks during pu
 berty. Threatened by a melodious bird that captivates his father’s atten
 tion\, he struggles to prove his worth and reclaim his place in the spotli
 ght.\n\nWithin Laws (14 Minutes)\n\nA couple\, on a journey to visit rural
  in-laws\, are terrorized by screams from the woods and a mysterious stalk
 er....\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2
