  Your Sisters (10 Minutes)\n\nA cerebral anthology/mystery about a disturb
 ing and new social media ecosystem\, where multiple lives intersect and co
 llide under the influence of sentient AI.\n\nMary/Uncanny (8 Minutes)\n\nT
 he lone survivor of a recent tragedy\, now a shut-in\, grapples with her d
 eteriorating mental state linked to a cursed childhood game.\n\nNail-Biter
  (18 Minutes)\n\nOn the eve of her eighteenth birthday\, anxious nail-bite
 r Amy Heller confronts her overbearing mother about their so-called family
  curse\, a finger-devouring creature that preys on those who bite their na
 ils\, just as the monster arrives to claim her as its next victim.\n\nNati
 ve Sin (14 Minutes)\n\nWhen a Native American Catholic priest returns to h
 is tribal land to perform an exorcism\, he must team up with his estranged
  medicine woman sister to battle a demonic force tied to the old Indian bo
 arding school and the sins of his own Church.\n\nThe Return Solution (14 M
 inutes)\n\nJack\, a grieving man in his thirties who recently lost his wif
 e\, turns to a mysterious drug called The Return Solution\, which promises
  to reconnect users with what once made them happy. Desperate to see her a
 gain\, he takes it and is briefly reunited with her through vivid visions.
  But after misreading the instructions and ingesting it incorrectly\, the 
 experience turns into a physical nightmare as his body begins viole...\n\n
