DESCRIPTION:Sleepbomb returns to Another Hole in the Head Film Festival wi
 th an all-new live score for the original 1931 horror classic Frankenstein
 \, starring Boris Karloff!\n\nFollowing their sold-out Balboa Theater perf
 ormance\, San Francisco's acclaimed cinematic psychedelic post-rock band r
 eturns for a second appearance\, bringing its signature sound to one of th
 e most iconic horror films of all time. Experience James Whale's legendary
  masterpiece like never before\, with a powerful\, immersive live soundtra
 ck performed in sync with the film.\n\nSince 2003\, Sleepbomb has performe
 d original live scores for genre classics throughout the West Coast\, incl
 uding The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari\, Nosferatu\, Metropolis\, George A. Rom
 ero's Night of the Living Dead (1968)\, and John Milius' Conan the Barbari
 an (1982).\n\nPlaying as part of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets:
  https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-frankenstein\n
 Details: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/12/ahith-fest-2026-frankenste
