SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Some summer camps are unforgettable. Others are downright dead
 ly. Welcome to Camp Arawak — where the summer of your nightmares begins 
 on VHS!\n\nWhen shy\, troubled Angela Baker arrives at Camp Arawak with he
 r protective cousin Ricky\, what should be a summer of swimming\, friendsh
 ip\, and teenage mischief quickly turns into a blood-soaked nightmare. As 
 campers and counselors begin meeting increasingly gruesome ends\, suspicio
 n spreads throughout the camp. Someone is hiding a deadly secret\, and nob
 ody is safe.\n\nReleased in 1983\, Sleepaway Camp has become one of the mo
 st beloved and notorious cult classics of the slasher era. Directed by Rob
 ert Hiltzik\, this wonderfully twisted slice of 1980s horror delivers outr
 ageous characters\, inventive kills\, dark humor\, and one of the most sho
 cking and unforgettable endings in horror movie history.\n\nFor this speci
 al Another Hole in the Head Film Festival screening\, Warped VHS presents 
 Sleepaway Camp straight from VHS tape\, projected onto the big screen at t
 he historic Balboa Theater in San Francisco!\n\nForget pristine digital re
 storations and polished 4K transfers. We're bringing back the glorious day
 s of the neighborhood video store — analog video\, tracking imperfection
 s\, and the unmistakable atmosphere of watching a forbidden horror movie o
 n a worn-out rental tape.\n\nWhether you're a longtime fan or experiencing
  the madness of Camp Arawak for the very first time\, this is the perfect 
 way to revisit one of the strangest\, sleaziest\, and most unfor...\n\nTic
 kets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-sleepaway
 -camp\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/12/ahith-fest-2026-sle
 epaway-camp-1-short-film-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7760419;-122.498063
