DESCRIPTION:A diverse collection of non-Feature films from varied genres.\
 n\nTitles are listed alphabetically\, not in their screening order.\n\nDog
  Mom (9 Minutes)\n\nA baby shower spirals into chaos when Rosalin confesse
 s she once gave birth to a dog — and will prove it to all these women sh
 e just met. Told through absurd comedy and warped nostalgia\, Dog Mom unea
 rths the heartbreak of two people whose love collapses under the weight of
  an unbelievable truth.\n\nDonation Box (5 Minutes)\n\nA late night stop a
 t a clothing donation box takes an unexpected turn.\n\nA Girl and Her Demo
 ns (5 Minutes)\n\nA woman brings home her blind date. But when she she lea
 ves him to make coffee\, the evening takes a sinister turn as he is hiding
  dark secrets. What he doesn’t know is that the woman also has demons of
  her own\n\nGobbledygook (12 Minutes)\n\nA puppet girl encounters an other
  worldly entity through her Television set with every click of the remote.
 \n\nGRYLU SKER: An Icelandic Ghost Story (26 Minutes)\n\nShipwrecked off t
 he coast of Iceland\, an explorer must fight for survival on a desolate is
 land inhabited by the bloodthirsty witch Grýla. This handcrafted film use
 s live action bunraku puppetry\, stop-motion animation\, and rotoscope ani
 mation to tell an epic tale set in the world of Icelandic folklore.\n\nLit
 tle One (12 Minutes)\n\nDuring an ordinary closing shift at their market\,
  a family is struck with evil as a blood-thirsty monster invades and infec
 ts one of their own. Following 9 year-old Alexa (Maya Marquez)\, as she...
 \n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-sh
 ort-films-10\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/13/ahith-fest-2
