DESCRIPTION:When she heads out for a simple desert getaway\, Theo\, a mill
 ennial struggling with her identity\, just wants a break from reality. Soo
 n she finds herself having to escape her hosts as they try to use her body
  to birth their dark god into the world.\n\n+ 3 Short Films\n\nThe Perfect
  Proposal (7 Minutes)\n\nAn anxious AI filmmaker tries to generate the per
 fect marriage proposal before attempting it in real life. But as each vers
 ion spirals further out of control\, he must confront the one thing no pro
 mpt can determine: her answer.\n\nThe Perfect Proposal is a self-reflexive
  AI meta-film in which the protagonist's attempts to generate a perfect pr
 oposal mirror the filmmaker's own attempts to control AI-generated images.
  The process of image generation becomes both the subject and the language
  of the film.\n\nThe Ick List (8 Minutes)\n\nA medical emergency strands a
  newlywed couple 50 miles from civilization.\n\nDate Night (4 Minutes)\n\n
 An unsuspecting Knucklehead goes on a date with a Satanic Witch in her lai
 r. They drink-watch a movie\, much like Jeffrey Dahmer would get drunk and
  make his lovers/victims watch Exorcist III.\n\nPlaying as part of Another
  Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-o
 f-events/ahith-2026-godmother\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/1
 2/16/ahith-fest-2026-godmother-3-short-films-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
