DESCRIPTION:Champagne Cabaret Holiday Party: A Wild\, Naughty Circus Chris
 tmas Show (SF)\nTicketful / Champagne Cabaret Holiday Party\nSee what happ
 ens when Santa comes down the wrong chimney?\nThe wildest holiday adventur
 e filled with circus mischief\, cabaret glamour\, and world-class performe
 rs from across the globe. Leave the kids at home for this not-safe-for-wor
 k party. Bring a date or friends or give tickets for the holidays to loved
  ones.\n\nNormally $30-$40\, you can Get Complimentary Tickets to Champagn
 e Cabaret Holiday Party for December 10-January 3 if you are a member of T
 icketful.\n\nHosts Marc and Svetlana are having a wild party. Santa is tip
 sy and the helpful elves aren’t helping. This party is going off the rai
 ls and every minute will be loved.\nThis is not another sugar-coated holid
 ay show. It’s a full-throttle celebration for grown-ups who want somethi
 ng bold\, festive\, and joyfully naughty — best enjoyed with a champagne
  cocktail.\nPut on the ugliest holiday sweater\, order a hot buttered rum\
 , and join the Champagne Cabaret Holiday Party!\nChampagne Cabaret Holiday
  Party\nDecember 10 – January 3\, 2027\n– Ticketful Comp Ticket Promot
 ion Dates\nGreat Star Theater\, 636 Jackson St. SF (Chinatown)\n5 Credits 
 for Tickets ($20 Ticketful membership gets you 10 credits a month) – Oth
 erwise tickets are $30-$40\nShowtimes\n\nThursday\, December 10\, 2026 –
  8:00 pm\nSunday\, December 13\, 2026 – 8:00 pm\nThursday\, December 17\
 , 2026 – 8:00 pm\nSunday\, December 20\, 2026 – 8:00 pm\nSunday\, Dece
 mber 27\, 2026 – 8:...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://ticketful.app/app/e
 vents?venueId=9fa3c2e2-e28f-49b1-8070-1e41ce581c90\nDetails: https://sf.fu
 ncheap.com/champagne-cabaret-holiday-party-a-wild-naughty-circus-christmas
 -show-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
