BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AHITH FEST 2026: The Texas Chain Saw Massacre – Presented by War
 ped VHS + 1 Short Film
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261217T230000
DTSTAMP:20261127T014655Z
UID:dothebay-18089082@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Before streaming. Before digital. Before horror became polishe
 d. There was VHS — and there was Leatherface.\n\nFive friends traveling 
 through rural Texas stumble upon a nightmare beyond imagination when they 
 encounter a seemingly abandoned farmhouse and the terrifying family that c
 alls it home. What begins as an innocent road trip quickly descends into o
 ne of the most relentless and disturbing experiences ever captured on film
 .\n\nDirected by Tobe Hooper\, The Texas Chain Saw Massacre (1974) forever
  changed the face of horror cinema. Shot on a shoestring budget with a raw
 \, documentary-like style\, the film shocked audiences worldwide and intro
 duced Leatherface\, one of the most iconic villains in movie history. More
  than 50 years later\, its atmosphere of dread\, unrelenting tension\, and
  unforgettable imagery remain just as powerful.\n\nFor this special Anothe
 r Hole in the Head Film Festival screening\, Warped VHS presents The Texas
  Chain Saw Massacre straight from VHS tape\, projected onto the big screen
  at the historic Balboa Theater in San Francisco!\n\nForget pristine digit
 al restorations and razor-sharp 4K. This is horror the old-school way — 
 analog video\, tracking imperfections\, and all the gritty nostalgia of di
 scovering a forbidden horror classic on a late-night VHS rental.\n\n+ 1 Sh
 ort Film\n\nNo Late Fees (13 Minutes)\n\nTwo video rental store employees 
 must face off against an alien threat in search of a specific 90s VHS clas
 sic.\n\nPlaying as part of Another Hole in the Head 2026\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.balboamovies.com/calendar-of-events/ahith-2026-the-texas-chain-saw-
 massacre\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/17/ahith-fest-2026-
 the-texas-chain-saw-massacre-presented-by-warped-vhs-1-short-film-tickets\
 nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7760419;-122.498063
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35528154/19c2649e-8a3d-453a-8c24-2eb5a0d62488.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T014655Z
LOCATION:Balboa Theater\, 3630 Balboa St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/17/ahith-fest-2026-the-texas-chain
 -saw-massacre-presented-by-warped-vhs-1-short-film-tickets
END:VEVENT
