SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:What to do this awkward holiday week where time stands still?!
 \nThe kids aren’t in school\, parents are off work\, all the stores are 
 closed and all 5 family generations are stewing together at home…\n\nWe 
 know: Come to a magic show!!\n\nTo finish out the year\, we're bringing yo
 u the funny\, strange\, and crazy kind of talent that you can only find in
  San Francisco. In true Vaudeville tradition you won't get just one act - 
 we're bringing you a full variety: magic\, comedy\, juggling\, crazy stunt
 s - truly something for every member of the family!\n\nYou're cordially in
 vited to a family friendly afternoon with four exciting street performers 
 within the cozy confines of Church Of Clown - the City’s newest crucible
  of clowning\, comedy and variety. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to s
 ee these stellar street performers inside and live\, out of the blustery w
 ind and cold or through a screen fooling Penn and Teller!\n\nMeet the cast
 :\nFRISCO FRED - Your host\, as seen on A&E\, Fox\, and PBS - a fun filled
  juggler\, comedian and escape artist.\nJONATHAN STRANGE - From Greenwich 
 Village to Pier 39 Jonathan combines\, magic\, circus and side show stunts
  into a theatrical adventure.\nDANNY CHENG - From the Magic Castle and Mag
 ic Live - One of the finest coin magicians you will ever see - a true arti
 st.\nPATRICK LIVINGSTONE - From Penn And Teller’s Fool Us ( he FOOLED em
 !) \, Chicago’s Magic Lounge and New York’s Monday Night Magic - a uni
 que blend of magic and theater.\n\nStreet Magic LIVE!\nDecember 26 + 27th\
 nDoors...\n\nTickets: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/street-magic-l
 ive--2026\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/26/street-magic-li
 ve-2026-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T014655Z
LOCATION:Church of Clown\, 2400 Bayshore Blvd\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94134
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/26/street-magic-live-2026-tickets
END:VEVENT
