BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jersey Boys
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270112T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270112T213000
DTSTAMP:20261127T014655Z
UID:dothebay-17884900@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:US Tour - 3 venues\n\nJersey Boys tells the true story of Fran
 kie Valli and The Four Seasons\, from New Jersey street corners to the Roc
 k and Roll Hall of Fame. This Tony Award winning musical brings their bigg
 est hits\, including "Sherry" and "Oh What a Night\," to life on stage.\n\
 nThe original Broadway sensation returns to the road! Celebrating 20 years
 -Jersey style!\n\nThey were just four guys from Jersey\, until they sang t
 heir very first note. They had a sound nobody had ever heard... and the ra
 dio just couldn’t get enough of. But while their harmonies were perfect 
 on stage\, off stage it was a very different story--a story that has made 
 them an international sensation all over again. The show features all thei
 r hits including Sherry\, Big Girls Don’t Cry\, Oh What a Night\, Walk L
 ike a Man\, Can’t Take My Eyes Off You\, Beggin’ and Working My Way Ba
 ck to You.\n\nGo behind the music and inside the story of Frankie Valli an
 d The Four Seasons in the Tony Award®-winning\, original Broadway sensati
 on\, Jersey Boys. From the streets of New Jersey to the Rock and Roll Hall
  of Fame\, this is the musical that’s too good to be true.\n\nSaenger Th
 eatre\n\nThrough Sun\, Sep 27\, 2026\n\nGolden Gate Theatre\n\nTue\, Jan 1
 2 - Sun\, Jan 17\, 2027\n\nSaroyan Theatre\n\nTue\, Feb 2 - Thu\, Feb 4\, 
 2027\n\nTickets: https://us.atgtickets.com/events/jersey-boys/\nDetails: h
 ttps://dothebay.com/events/2027/1/12/jersey-boys-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7825715;-122.4110742
